"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"},{"surface":"கள்வர்","parts":[{"text":"கள்வர்","lemma":"கள்வர்","gloss":"bandits"}],"gloss":"bandits"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பொன்புனை","parts":[{"text":"பொன்","lemma":"பொன்","gloss":"gold/metal"},{"text":"புனை","lemma":"புனை","gloss":"adorn/bind"}],"gloss":"gold-adorned"},{"surface":"பகழி","parts":[{"text":"பகழி","lemma":"பகழி","gloss":"arrow"}],"gloss":"arrow"},{"surface":"செப்பம்","parts":[{"text":"செப்பம்","lemma":"செப்பம்","gloss":"straightness"}],"gloss":"straightness"},{"surface":"கொண்மார்","parts":[{"text":"கொண்மார்","lemma":"கொண்மார்","gloss":"in order to make straight"}],"gloss":"in order to make straight","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உகிர்நுதி","parts":[{"text":"உகிர்","lemma":"உகிர்","gloss":"fingernail"},{"text":"நுதி","lemma":"நுதி","gloss":"tip"}],"gloss":"fingernail tip"},{"surface":"புரட்டும்","parts":[{"text":"புரட்டு","lemma":"புரட்டு","gloss":"flip/test"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"flipping/testing"},{"surface":"ஓசை","parts":[{"text":"ஓசை","lemma":"ஓசை","gloss":"sound"}],"gloss":"sound"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"போல","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செங்கால்","parts":[{"text":"செம்","lemma":"செம்மை","gloss":"red"},{"text":"கால்","lemma":"கால்","gloss":"leg"}],"gloss":"red-legged"},{"surface":"பல்லி","parts":[{"text":"பல்லி","lemma":"பல்லி","gloss":"lizard"}],"gloss":"lizard"},{"surface":"தன்றுணை","parts":[{"text":"தன்","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"its"},{"text":"துணை","lemma":"துணை","gloss":"mate"}],"gloss":"its mate"},{"surface":"பயிரும்","parts":[{"text":"பயிர்","lemma":"பயிர்","gloss":"call/summon"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"habitual relative participle"}],"gloss":"calling"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அம்","parts":[{"text":"அம்","lemma":"அம்","gloss":"beautiful"}],"gloss":"beautiful"},{"surface":"கால்","parts":[{"text":"கால்","lemma":"கால்","gloss":"stem/branch"}],"gloss":"stem/branch"},{"surface":"கள்ளி","parts":[{"text":"கள்ளி","lemma":"கள்ளி","gloss":"spurge cactus"}],"gloss":"spurge cactus"},{"surface":"அம்","parts":[{"text":"அம்","lemma":"அம்","gloss":"euphonic increment"}],"gloss":"euphonic increment"},{"surface":"காடு","parts":[{"text":"காடு","lemma":"காடு","gloss":"wilderness"}],"gloss":"wilderness"},{"surface":"இறந்தார்","parts":[{"text":"இற","lemma":"இற","gloss":"cross/traverse"},{"text":"ந்த்","lemma":"த்து","gloss":"past tense infix"},{"text":"ஆர்","lemma":"ஆர்","gloss":"third person honorific suffix"}],"gloss":"he traversed"},{"surface":"ஏ","parts":[{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"emphasis particle"}]}],"literal":"Will he not think [of us], indeed, O friend? Bandits / to make straight their gold-adorned arrows, / like the sound of flipping with the tip of a fingernail, / the red-legged lizard calls its mate, / in the wilderness of beautiful-stemmed cactus, which he traversed.","translation":"Will he not think of us, my friend? He who traversed the wilderness of beautiful-stemmed cactus, where the red-legged lizard calls its mate with a clicking sound, just like the sound made by bandits flicking their gold-adorned arrows with their fingernails to test their straightness.","modern":"தோழியே! கொள்ளைக்காரர்கள் தங்களுடைய பொன்னால் அலங்கரிக்கப்பட்ட அம்புகளின் நேர்த்தியைச் சோதிப்பதற்காகத் தம் நகத்தின் நுனியால் தட்டிப் பார்க்கும் ஒலியைப் போல, சிவந்த கால்களைக் கொண்ட பல்லி தன் துணையை அழைக்கும் அழகிய தண்டுடைய கள்ளிச் செடிகள் நிறைந்த பாலைவனக் காட்டைத் கடந்து சென்ற நம் தலைவர், நம்மைப் பற்றி நினைக்க மாட்டாரோ?","explanation":"The friend (தோழி) speaks to the anxious heroine (தலைவி) to comfort her during the hero's absence. The hero has gone through the harsh desert path (பாலை) to earn wealth. In that desert, bandits test the straightness of their gold-bound arrows by flicking them with their fingernails, making a clicking sound. The red-legged lizard makes a similar clicking sound to call its mate. Hearing this call of the lizard to its mate, the hero will surely be reminded of his own mate and think of her. This poignant image of the desert landscape serves as an implied metaphor, assuring the heroine that the hero's love remains steadfast.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,3.0],[3.0,3.2],[3.2,3.8],[3.8,4.45],[4.62,5.6],[5.6,6.1],[6.1,6.2],[6.2,6.8],[6.8,8.3],[8.3,8.5],[8.5,9.0],[9.0,9.2],[9.2,10.41],[10.66,11.07],[11.07,11.65],[11.65,11.91]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,0.9],[0.9,1.4],[1.4,1.8],[1.8,3.4],[3.4,3.6],[3.6,3.6],[3.6,3.6],[3.6,3.6],[3.6,6.7],[6.7,6.7],[6.7,7.4],[7.4,9.0],[9.0,9.1],[9.1,9.6],[9.6,9.86],[9.86,9.9],[9.9,11.57],[11.57,12.7],[12.7,12.93]]}}